-ContractKV makes a structurally reusable prompt prefix into a governed multi-tenant KV service object. CALC provides a legal physical prefix; execution-scoped token-path evidence controls admissibility; PSTP controls first shared visibility; and a versioned Service-Template Certificate allows authorized consumers to amortize qualification. None of these decisions can replace the other three.
