+Qwen admits one HotpotQA source with positive raw F1 (54/54); Mistral/Llama admit another with zero raw F1 (0/54 and 0/48). This limits useful-task coverage. Qwen's 54 decisions/load contain three PASS, 24 exact-observation restrictions, 18 candidate/EOS margin failures and nine output-contract failures. In six additional gate ON/OFF cells, 54 matched decisions are identical, both policies make 21 verifier RPCs with 18 failures, and no Goodput advantage is observed. The four main groups' 96 p99 requests all route L0; only one directly overlaps preceding-wave qualification, so immediate failed verification does not explain all tails. Calibration, main and gate cells total 37 cells/11,640 business requests, independently recomputed from the archived package.
