+\section{Evidence Register and Version Boundaries}
+\label{sec:s-evidence-register}
+The accompanying artifact includes a machine-readable protocol register, selected source summaries and SHA256 digests. Main performance cohorts use the archived implementation at \texttt{84dd0366}; independent authorization, growing-history, original RULER rechecks, fixed-arrival and exploratory studies retain their own freezes and source records. The added integration is not assigned retroactively to older measurements. The public evidence snapshot through \texttt{bd449251} contains these experiment records; manuscript source and figure revisions have a separate delivery commit. Reproduction scripts rebuild the manuscripts and measured-data figure without invoking a model.
